		{
			dependencies: ["15169FE8866CD32A"]
			description: [
				"The elven folk of Alfheim have proposed a trade agreement, you trade resources not available in &otheir&r world in return for resources not available in &oyour&r world. Manasteel in return for elementium is one of these trades and one you will need to make. "
				""
				"向阿尔芙海姆传送门投入2个曼纳斯钢锭，精灵会返还一个元素锭。"
